He bought 10 red ties at $60 each:

$$
10 \times 60 = 600
$$

---

### Step 5: Calculate the Total Amount Spent
Total cost is the sum of the cost of the blue and red ties:

$$
200 + 600 = \boxed{800}
$$

---

